[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3025334532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108137#issuecomment-3025334532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108137","id":3025334532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60UvEE","user":{"login":"Fgico","id":9402139,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MDIxMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9402139?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico","html_url":"https://github.com/Fgico","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgico/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-01T19:59:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T21:57:39Z","body":"The AnimatableBody node works as intended, where when using the floating motion mode it only considers the characterBody's \"moving platform wall layers\", but also needs the collision layers properly configured to be able to influence the body.\nThis should basically be considered as a \"StickyArea\" node proposal, which would work like the animatableBody node, but it would allow characterBodies to pass through it.\nThis would definitely have it's uses, as a banal example a game like Frogger would vastly benefit something like it.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3025334532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3066703123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108137#issuecomment-3066703123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108137","id":3066703123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62yi0T","user":{"login":"pranabekka","id":20282735,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjgyNzM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20282735?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka","html_url":"https://github.com/pranabekka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranabekka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-13T07:57:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T07:57:33Z","body":"I think the AnimatableBody is perfect for this. It has moving floor functionality for grounded motion mode, and should also have moving floor functionality for floating motion mode. Floor layers are being ignored in floating motion mode and have no other use in top-down mode. It even makes intuitive sense that an AnimatableBody as floor layer in floating mode means you can step on that floor and you'll get moved along with it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3066703123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]